---
import { HeartHandshake, ShieldCheck, UsersRound } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<section
  id="welcome"
  class="bg-white py-16 lg:py-20"
  aria-labelledby="welcome-heading"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1400px] px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2.25rem] bg-brand-navy px-5 py-8 shadow-hero sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-10">
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-28 -top-32 h-72 w-72 rounded-full border-[30px] border-white/5"></div>
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-36 left-[38%] h-72 w-72 rounded-full border-[38px] border-brand-orange/10"></div>

      <div class="relative grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] lg:gap-14">
        <figure class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-[240px] lg:max-w-[280px]">
          <div class="absolute -inset-3 rounded-full border-2 border-brand-orange/40" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <img
            src="/images/doctors/olgaBustinza.webp"
            alt="Foto de la M.V.Z. Olga Bustinza, fundadora de Ariel's Clinic"
            width="388"
            height="388"
            loading="lazy"
            class="relative aspect-square w-full rounded-full object-cover object-top shadow-xl ring-4 ring-white/10"
          />
          <figcaption class="mt-5 text-center text-white">
            <span class="block text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-orange">
              Desde 2003
            </span>
            <strong class="mt-1 block text-lg font-semibold">Una vocación que continúa</strong>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>

        <article class="text-white">
          <header>
            <p class="mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-orange">
              Nuestra forma de cuidar
            </p>
            <h2
              id="welcome-heading"
              class="max-w-xl text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-4xl lg:text-[2.75rem]"
            >
              Profesionalismo y cuidado en cada etapa
            </h2>
            <div class="mt-5 h-1 w-12 rounded-full bg-brand-orange"></div>
          </header>

          <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-white/75 sm:text-lg">
            Contamos con un equipo altamente calificado y tecnología de vanguardia
            para ofrecer atención integral, desde consultas y cirugías hasta
            cuidados intensivos y servicios de Spa.
          </p>

          <blockquote class="mt-7 border-l-2 border-brand-orange pl-4 text-sm leading-6 text-white/70">
            “Desde que fundé la clínica en 2003, mi sueño ha sido crear un lugar
            donde la excelencia médica y el amor por los animales se unan.”
            <footer class="mt-2 font-semibold text-white">
              M.V.Z. Olga Bustinza · Fundadora
            </footer>
          </blockquote>

          <div class="mt-9 grid gap-5 border-t border-white/15 pt-7 sm:grid-cols-3">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-orange text-white">
                <HeartHandshake aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5" stroke-width="1.8" />
              </span>
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold leading-5 text-white/90">Atención<br />personalizada</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/10 text-white">
                <UsersRound aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5" stroke-width="1.8" />
              </span>
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold leading-5 text-white/90">Equipo<br />especializado</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/10 text-white">
                <ShieldCheck aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5" stroke-width="1.8" />
              </span>
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold leading-5 text-white/90">Seguridad y<br />confianza</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
